neximageeditor (3.0.0-1) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Rewrite the user interface with GTK 4 (gtkmm); Qt6 is no longer used.
  * GIMP-style layout: menu bar, toolbox, tool options bar, rulers, document
    tabs, Colour (HSV) panel, Layers and History panels, status bar.
  * Core features: marquee/lasso/magic wand selections, move with selected
    pixels, brush, eraser, bucket, gradient, eyedropper, crop, free transform,
    raster text, rectangle/ellipse shapes, zoom/pan, undo/redo, blend modes,
    opacity, adjustments, filters with live preview, image/canvas size, rotate
    and flip, PNG/JPEG/WebP/BMP/TIFF import and export, .nxe save/load.
  * Regressions from 2.x (OpenCV build): curves, presets, background removal,
    OpenCV sharpen, vector text/shape layers and histogram are not included.

 -- Hyggshi <hyggshidev@gmail.com>  Sat, 10 Oct 2026 00:00:00 +0700
